/P 183 0 R
/E (The intersection of environmental biotechnology and artificial intelligence has witnessed rapid advancements, particularly in the computational discovery of novel enzymes. To engineer a robust and highly accurate predictive system like PlasticDeg, it is essential to establish a deep understanding of both the biological mechanisms underlying polymer degradation and the state-of-the-art computational methodologies used to model them. This literature review explores the foundational research that informed the architectural and strategic decisions of this project.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
