629 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 191 0 R
/E (The system must strictly maintain raw datasets in a read-only state. Data processing scripts must output to a separate, versioned directory \(data/processed_v2/\) to prevent the accidental corruption of ground truth biological data.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
630 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
