/T (Primary Curation \(The "Gold" Tier\): The ground truth positive dataset was extracted from the PAZy \(Plastics-Active Enzymes\) database. These sequences represent experimentally verified, high-confidence plastic-degrading enzymes.)
/E (Primary Curation \(The "Gold" Tier\): The ground truth positive dataset was extracted from the PAZy \(Plastics-Active Enzymes\) database. These sequences represent experimentally verified, high-confidence plastic-degrading enzymes.)
