739 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 199 0 R
/E (Chapter 6 has outlined the comprehensive system design and architecture of the PlasticDeg pipeline. By decoupling the architecture into distinct Data Ingestion, Clustering, Feature Extraction, and Classification layers, the system maintains strict scientific rigor. The integration of MMseqs2 homology splitting effectively eradicates train-test data leakage, while the application of frozen ESM-2 embeddings and tier-weighted classifiers efficiently handles the complexities of biological sequence data. The detailed implementation of these modules ensures that the predictive framework is not only highly accurate but also fully reproducible and biologically sound. This robust architectural foundation directly enables the honest, high-fidelity model evaluations and stress tests discussed in the subsequent results chapter.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
