751 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 200 0 R
/E (The predictive framework was evaluated using a strictly held-out homology test set to accurately gauge real-world generalization. The total dataset comprising 1,485 unique sequences was clustered via MMseqs2 and split into a training set \(n = 1155; 136 positives, 1019 negatives\) and a testing set \(n = 330; 53 positives, 277 negatives\). All sequences were embedded into a 1280-dimensional space using the frozen ESM-2 \(650M\) transformer model.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
752 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 200 0 R
/E (The models \(Random Forest and Logistic Regression\) were trained using a v2 tier-weighted strategy \(Gold weight 1.0, Silver weight 0.5\) applied after standard class balancing. Crucially, the operating probability thresholds were frozen dynamically during training to achieve a target recall greater then 80% on the train set \(Random Forest threshold: 0.8799; Logistic Regression threshold: 0.9998\). All subsequent test evaluations utilized these frozen thresholds to prevent test-set tuning.)
/Pg 39 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
