/T (Testing in a bioinformatics pipeline extends beyond standard software debugging; it requires continuous validation of biological data integrity and mathematical model constraints. The testing strategy for PlasticDeg was formulated to guarantee that data leakage was strictly prevented, structural data transformations \(like deduplication\) occurred flawlessly, and evaluation metrics were calculated without threshold-tuning biases.)
/E (Testing in a bioinformatics pipeline extends beyond standard software debugging; it requires continuous validation of biological data integrity and mathematical model constraints. The testing strategy for PlasticDeg was formulated to guarantee that data leakage was strictly prevented, structural data transformations \(like deduplication\) occurred flawlessly, and evaluation metrics were calculated without threshold-tuning biases.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
