/Title (Continuous Metagenomic Pipeline Expansion: As the plastisphere expands, newly sequenced microbial genomes are constantly deposited into public databases. The current architecture's incremental .npz caching system is designed to scale. Future updates should automate the ingestion of broader metagenomic datasets, utilizing the current frozen model in a semi-supervised learning loop to continuously mine for rare degradation pathways.)
