/Title (Enhancing Biological Interpretability \(XAI\): The "black box" nature of deep transformer embeddings limits biochemical interpretability. Future work should focus on Explainable AI \(XAI\) techniques, such as applying attention-mapping algorithms to the transformer heads. This would allow researchers to trace the model's predictions back to specific amino acid residues, potentially highlighting novel catalytic triads or mutational hotspots for directed evolution.)
