/Title (The testing environment was localized within the project's Python conda environment. Data validation tests were programmatic logic checks integrated into the execution scripts \(e.g., integrate_expansion.py\). Machine learning validations utilized scikit-learn's strictly separated fit and predict modules, while the probe_hard_negatives.py script served as the primary automated integration testing environment to audit frozen model bounds against completely novel sequences.)
/Dest [44 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2589 0 R
