/Title (Vectorization Process: The model's weights are "frozen" \(not updated during our training phase\). Each variable-length protein sequence is passed through the transformer. The token representations from the final layer \(Layer 33\) are mean-pooled to produce a fixed 1280-dimensional numerical embedding for every sequence. This high-dimensional vector mathematically captures the biological properties of the enzyme.)
/Dest [36 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 2694 0 R
/Next 2690 0 R
>>
