/Title (BLAST-Based Expansion \(The "Silver" Tier\): To increase the model's coverage, the Gold sequences were used as queries to search external biological libraries \(such as PlasticDB\) using local BLAST+. To ensure quality, the implementation enforced strict algorithmic filters: only hits meeting a minimum of 90% sequence identity and 90% query coverage were retained. This expanded the pool to 325 raw sequences.)
/Dest [35 0 R /Fit]
