/Title (Integration and Sequence-Level Deduplication: A critical preparation step was the merging of these datasets. Because identical amino acid sequences will yield mathematically identical ESM-2 embeddings, retaining duplicate accessions would artificially inflate the dataset size without adding predictive value. The implementation applied strict sequence-level deduplication, collapsing the raw hits down to 189 canonical, unique positive sequences for training.)
